[ti:Où es-tu maintenant ? / 你现在在哪里？ / Where Are You Now?]
[ar:Moodify]
[al:]
[by:Moodify — score/MIDI-aligned bilingual lyrics]
[offset:0]

[00:13.93]你现在在哪里？ / Where are you now?
[00:16.84]不是在地图上，也不是在城市里 / Not on the map, not in the city
[00:23.91]而是在你那颗正在改变的心里 / But in your changing heart
[00:26.83]在你的疲惫里，在你的渴望里 / In your weariness, in your desires
[00:31.23]我不想只去爱 / I don't want to love only
[00:34.84]那个最初打动我的你 / The one who moved me at the beginning
[00:38.88]我也想认出 / I also want to recognize
[00:41.57]那个以另一种模样归来的你 / The one who returns in a different way
[00:46.32]时间并不要求 / Time does not ask
[00:49.35]爱情永远停在原地 / That love remain still
[00:53.06]它只问我们是否愿意 / It asks whether we are willing
[00:56.55]继续在流动中寻找彼此 / To keep searching for each other in the current
[01:04.32]你现在在哪里？ / Where are you now?
[01:08.03]我想再靠近一点 / I want to come a little closer
[01:10.36]不强迫你回到从前 / Without forcing you back
[01:12.91]也不让你消失在我的回忆里 / Without losing you in my memories
[01:15.82]你现在在哪里？ / Where are you now?
[01:19.19]只需告诉我一束微光 / Just tell me of a light
[01:23.02]一种恐惧、一份需要、一次沉默 / A fear, a need, a silence
[01:25.91]我便会更轻柔地走向你 / And I will walk more gently toward you
[01:31.96]我也已经不再和从前一样 / I am no longer the same either
[01:35.67]我有了新的谨慎 / I have new cautions
[01:39.26]有了过去不曾有的迟缓 / Slownesses I did not have before
[01:42.64]也有一些温柔正开始生长 / And tendernesses that are beginning
[01:46.12]如果你愿意，我们不要只活在 / If you want, let us not live
[01:48.68]那些最美好的时刻里 / Only in the most beautiful moments
[01:52.03]让我们今天就创造一个地方，哪怕很小 / Let us create today, however small
[01:55.99]让明天也能在这里留下回忆 / A place that tomorrow can remember
[02:00.29]这并不是终点 / This is not the end
[02:04.22]当两个人都在改变 / When two people change
[02:07.82]它也许是一份邀请 / It may be an invitation
[02:11.88]邀请我们重新介绍自己 / To introduce ourselves again
[02:15.26]你现在在哪里？ / Where are you now?
[02:18.27]我不想太快说再见 / I don't want to say goodbye too quickly
[02:21.99]我想提出那个温柔的问题 / I want to ask the tender question
[02:25.48]让我们仍然留在鲜活的生命里 / That keeps us among the living
[02:28.02]你现在在哪里？ / Where are you now?
[02:31.85]如果你还愿意让我靠近 / If you still let me come to you
[02:35.92]我不会把你的改变看作一种失去 / I will not take your change for a loss
[02:40.80]而会把它看作一条路 / But as a path
[02:44.28]一条我愿意与你一起学习的路 / That I want to learn with you
